{"seq":3,"slug":"efficient-attention-taxonomy","title":"高效注意力谱系","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/efficient-attention-mechanisms/foundations/efficient-attention-taxonomy","wordCount":1406,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"高效注意力谱系\">高效注意力谱系</h1><p>到这里你已经知道注意力贵在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>N</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N^2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>、贵分算力与访存两副面孔。市面上号称「高效注意力」的方法有上百种，名字花哨、彼此关系混乱。这一篇的任务是给它们一张统一的地图：用两个正交的维度把所有方法归位，让你拿到任何一个新方法时，能在十秒内判断它属于哪一类、和已知方法是替代还是叠加。这张谱系也是后面三章的目录索引——每一类都会指向它的主讲篇目。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-两个正交维度定坐标\">核心概念：两个正交维度定坐标</h2><p>划分高效注意力，最有用的不是按论文年代或作者，而是问两个独立的问题：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>它动的是数学复杂度，还是硬件访存？</strong> 前者真的减少了配对/乘法（改算法），后者计算量不变、只减少数据搬运（改实现）。这两条线正交，可以叠加。</li>\n<li><strong>如果动复杂度，它用什么手段把 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>N</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N^2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 降下来？</strong> 是少看一些 token（稀疏）、换掉 softmax 重排矩阵乘（线性）、还是用低秩/随机特征近似那张稠密矩阵（低秩核）。</li>\n</ol>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    Root[&quot;高效注意力&quot;] --&gt; Alg[&quot;改算法&lt;br/&gt;降低渐进复杂度&quot;]&#10;    Root --&gt; IO[&quot;改实现&lt;br/&gt;不变复杂度,减访存&quot;]&#10;    Alg --&gt; Sparse[&quot;稀疏&lt;br/&gt;每 token 只看子集&lt;br/&gt;O(N√N)→O(N)&quot;]&#10;    Alg --&gt; Linear[&quot;线性&lt;br/&gt;去 softmax,重排矩阵乘&lt;br/&gt;O(N)&quot;]&#10;    Alg --&gt; LowRank[&quot;低秩/核&lt;br/&gt;有界近似稠密矩阵&lt;br/&gt;O(N)&quot;]&#10;    IO --&gt; Flash[&quot;FlashAttention&lt;br/&gt;分块+在线softmax&quot;]&#10;    IO --&gt; Recompute[&quot;分块/重计算&lt;br/&gt;反向省显存+多卡并行&quot;]&#10;    IO --&gt; Paged[&quot;分页注意力&lt;br/&gt;KV 缓存分页管理&quot;]&#10;    Root --&gt; Hybrid[&quot;混合架构&lt;br/&gt;线性层+少量全注意力层&quot;]\">flowchart TD\n    Root[\"高效注意力\"] --&gt; Alg[\"改算法&lt;br/&gt;降低渐进复杂度\"]\n    Root --&gt; IO[\"改实现&lt;br/&gt;不变复杂度,减访存\"]\n    Alg --&gt; Sparse[\"稀疏&lt;br/&gt;每 token 只看子集&lt;br/&gt;O(N√N)→O(N)\"]\n    Alg --&gt; Linear[\"线性&lt;br/&gt;去 softmax,重排矩阵乘&lt;br/&gt;O(N)\"]\n    Alg --&gt; LowRank[\"低秩/核&lt;br/&gt;有界近似稠密矩阵&lt;br/&gt;O(N)\"]\n    IO --&gt; Flash[\"FlashAttention&lt;br/&gt;分块+在线softmax\"]\n    IO --&gt; Recompute[\"分块/重计算&lt;br/&gt;反向省显存+多卡并行\"]\n    IO --&gt; Paged[\"分页注意力&lt;br/&gt;KV 缓存分页管理\"]\n    Root --&gt; Hybrid[\"混合架构&lt;br/&gt;线性层+少量全注意力层\"]</pre><p>把这两个维度铺成一张总表，就是本 hub 的全景索引：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>类别</th>\n<th>核心思想</th>\n<th>复杂度</th>\n<th>改的是</th>\n<th>代表方法</th>\n<th>主讲篇</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>稀疏注意力</td>\n<td>每 token 只关注子集</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>N</mi><msqrt><mi>N</mi></msqrt><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>→</mo><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>N</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(N\\sqrt N)\\to O(N)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1767em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mord sqrt\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9267em;\"><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;padding-left:0.833em;\">N</span></span><span style=\"top:-2.8867em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"hide-tail\" style=\"min-width:0.853em;height:1.08em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"1.08em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 1080\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin slice\"><path d=\"M95,702\nc-2.7,0,-7.17,-2.7,-13.5,-8c-5.8,-5.3,-9.5,-10,-9.5,-14\nc0,-2,0.3,-3.3,1,-4c1.3,-2.7,23.83,-20.7,67.5,-54\nc44.2,-33.3,65.8,-50.3,66.5,-51c1.3,-1.3,3,-2,5,-2c4.7,0,8.7,3.3,12,10\ns173,378,173,378c0.7,0,35.3,-71,104,-213c68.7,-142,137.5,-285,206.5,-429\nc69,-144,104.5,-217.7,106.5,-221\nl0 -0\nc5.3,-9.3,12,-14,20,-14\nH400000v40H845.2724\ns-225.272,467,-225.272,467s-235,486,-235,486c-2.7,4.7,-9,7,-19,7\nc-6,0,-10,-1,-12,-3s-194,-422,-194,-422s-65,47,-65,47z\nM834 80h400000v40h-400000z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1133em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>算法</td>\n<td>Longformer、BigBird、NSA、MoBA</td>\n<td><a href=\"../sparse-linear/sparse-attention\">稀疏注意力</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>线性注意力</td>\n<td>去 softmax + 结合律重排</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>N</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(N)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>算法</td>\n<td>Performer 思路、RWKV-7、GLA、DeltaNet、Lightning</td>\n<td><a href=\"../sparse-linear/linear-attention\">线性注意力</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>低秩与核</td>\n<td>近似稠密注意力矩阵</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>N</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(N)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>算法</td>\n<td>Linformer、Performer、Nyströmformer</td>\n<td><a href=\"../sparse-linear/low-rank-kernel\">低秩与核方法</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>IO 感知 kernel</td>\n<td>不落地 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>N</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N^2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 矩阵</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>N</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(N^2)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0641em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 计算 / <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>N</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(N)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 显存</td>\n<td>实现</td>\n<td>FlashAttention 1/2/3/4</td>\n<td><a href=\"../io-aware/flash-attention\">FlashAttention</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>分块/重计算</td>\n<td>反向重算 + 多卡分序列</td>\n<td>同上</td>\n<td>实现</td>\n<td>重计算、Ring Attention、序列并行</td>\n<td><a href=\"../io-aware/blockwise-recompute\">分块与重计算</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>分页注意力</td>\n<td>像虚拟内存管 KV</td>\n<td>同上</td>\n<td>实现</td>\n<td>PagedAttention / vLLM</td>\n<td><a href=\"../io-aware/paged-attention\">分页注意力</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>混合架构</td>\n<td>大多数层用线性，少数用全注意力</td>\n<td>近 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>N</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(N)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>算法组合</td>\n<td>Jamba、MiniMax-01、Hymba 类</td>\n<td><a href=\"../practice/efficient-attention-in-practice\">落地与边界</a></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"改算法-稀疏-线性-低秩的分工\">改算法：稀疏、线性、低秩的分工</h2><p>这三类都降渐进复杂度，但思路截然不同，值得在地图上分清。</p>\n<p><strong>稀疏</strong>回答「看谁」——保留 softmax 的精确语义，只是让注意力矩阵大部分位置为零。局部窗口、跨步、全局枢纽 token 是经典模式，2025 年的 NSA、MoBA 则让稀疏模式可训练。它的优点是质量损失可控、能直接套在现有架构上；难点是稀疏要打在不损信息的地方，且不规则稀疏对硬件不友好。</p>\n<p><strong>线性</strong>回答「怎么算」——用特征映射 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ϕ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\phi</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ϕ</span></span></span></span></span> 替掉 softmax 的指数核，借结合律把 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>ϕ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>Q</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi>ϕ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>K</mi><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">⊤</mi></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi>V</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(\\phi(Q)\\phi(K)^\\top)V</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0991em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ϕ</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ϕ</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">⊤</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span></span></span></span></span> 重排成 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ϕ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>Q</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>ϕ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>K</mi><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">⊤</mi></msup><mi>V</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\phi(Q)(\\phi(K)^\\top V)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0991em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ϕ</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ϕ</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">⊤</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，于是不再需要构造 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo>×</mo><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N\\times N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> 矩阵，复杂度直降 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>N</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(N)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，并暴露出一个固定大小的递推状态。它与状态空间模型在数学上汇流（见 <a href=\"../../state-space-models-mamba/foundations/ssm-fundamentals\">60_state-space-models-mamba</a>）。代价是固定状态容量有限，长程精确检索能力弱于全注意力。</p>\n<p><strong>低秩与核</strong>回答「近似到什么程度」——直接假设那张注意力矩阵低秩，或用随机特征无偏估计 softmax 核，用可证明的误差界换线性复杂度。它和线性注意力常被混为一谈，区别在于：线性注意力是「换一种精确可重排的机制」，低秩核是「对原始 softmax 做有界近似」。</p>\n<h2 id=\"改实现-io-感知三件套\">改实现：IO 感知三件套</h2><p>另一条正交线根本不碰复杂度。FlashAttention 仍做满 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>N</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N^2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 次乘法，但靠分块与在线 softmax 让中间矩阵从不写回显存，把瓶颈从访存搬回算力，显存从 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>N</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(N^2)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0641em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 降到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>N</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(N)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>。它的三个分支分别覆盖不同场景：前向 kernel（FlashAttention 本体）、反向与多卡（重计算 + Ring Attention）、推理解码（分页注意力）。</p>\n<p>理解「正交」是用好这张图的关键：你完全可以在 FlashAttention 的 kernel 里实现一个稀疏掩码，收益相乘；也可以给线性注意力写 IO 感知的并行扫描 kernel。改算法省的是「该算多少」，改实现省的是「算的时候怎么搬数据」，两者不冲突。</p>\n<h2 id=\"怎么用这张谱系做判断\">怎么用这张谱系做判断</h2><p>拿到一个新方法时，按这个决策顺序套：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    New[&quot;一个新的高效注意力方法&quot;] --&gt; Q1{&quot;它减少了乘法/配对数吗&quot;}&#10;    Q1 --&gt;|&quot;是&quot;| Q2{&quot;用什么手段&quot;}&#10;    Q1 --&gt;|&quot;否,只改 kernel/访存&quot;| IO[&quot;归入 IO 感知&quot;]&#10;    Q2 --&gt;|&quot;让 token 少看一些&quot;| Sparse[&quot;归入稀疏&quot;]&#10;    Q2 --&gt;|&quot;去 softmax 重排矩阵乘&quot;| Linear[&quot;归入线性&quot;]&#10;    Q2 --&gt;|&quot;低秩/随机特征近似矩阵&quot;| LowRank[&quot;归入低秩核&quot;]&#10;    Sparse --&gt; Combine[&quot;再问:能否与 IO 感知叠加？通常能&quot;]&#10;    Linear --&gt; Combine&#10;    LowRank --&gt; Combine&#10;    IO --&gt; Combine\">flowchart TD\n    New[\"一个新的高效注意力方法\"] --&gt; Q1{\"它减少了乘法/配对数吗\"}\n    Q1 --&gt;|\"是\"| Q2{\"用什么手段\"}\n    Q1 --&gt;|\"否,只改 kernel/访存\"| IO[\"归入 IO 感知\"]\n    Q2 --&gt;|\"让 token 少看一些\"| Sparse[\"归入稀疏\"]\n    Q2 --&gt;|\"去 softmax 重排矩阵乘\"| Linear[\"归入线性\"]\n    Q2 --&gt;|\"低秩/随机特征近似矩阵\"| LowRank[\"归入低秩核\"]\n    Sparse --&gt; Combine[\"再问:能否与 IO 感知叠加？通常能\"]\n    Linear --&gt; Combine\n    LowRank --&gt; Combine\n    IO --&gt; Combine</pre><p>这套坐标系也直接服务于 <a href=\"../practice/attention-selection\">选型权衡</a>：先用它定位候选方法属于哪一格，再去权衡质量/速度/显存。需要强调的是边界——本 hub 不讲完全替代注意力的路线（如纯 SSM，属 <a href=\"../../state-space-models-mamba/\">60</a>），也不讲 KV 缓存资源本身的管理（属 <a href=\"../../kv-cache-optimization/\">71</a>）；谱系里出现它们只是为了标清边界。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>用两个正交维度给所有高效注意力定坐标：<strong>改算法（降复杂度）还是改实现（减访存）</strong>，以及若降复杂度则用稀疏/线性/低秩哪种手段。</li>\n<li>改算法三分工：稀疏管「看谁」、线性管「怎么算」、低秩核管「近似到什么程度」；它们思路不同、可组合。</li>\n<li>改实现三件套：FlashAttention（前向 kernel）、分块重计算（反向 + 多卡）、分页注意力（解码），都不改复杂度只减访存。</li>\n<li>两条线正交、可叠加：稀疏掩码可以跑在 FlashAttention kernel 里，收益相乘。</li>\n<li>这张谱系是后三章的索引，也是 <a href=\"../practice/attention-selection\">选型权衡</a> 的起点；纯 SSM 与 KV 缓存管理是相邻但不重叠的兄弟 hub。</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"延伸阅读-跨库链接\">延伸阅读 / 跨库链接</h3><ul>\n<li>同章前置：<a href=\"why-attention-expensive\">为何注意力昂贵</a>、<a href=\"complexity-bottleneck\">二次复杂度瓶颈</a></li>\n<li>各类主讲：<a href=\"../sparse-linear/sparse-attention\">稀疏注意力</a>、<a href=\"../sparse-linear/linear-attention\">线性注意力</a>、<a href=\"../io-aware/flash-attention\">FlashAttention</a></li>\n<li>跨 hub：替代注意力的整条路线见 <a href=\"../../state-space-models-mamba/foundations/sequence-modeling-landscape\">60_state-space-models-mamba 序列建模全景</a></li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"高效注意力谱系","id":"高效注意力谱系"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：两个正交维度定坐标","id":"核心概念-两个正交维度定坐标"},{"level":2,"text":"改算法：稀疏、线性、低秩的分工","id":"改算法-稀疏-线性-低秩的分工"},{"level":2,"text":"改实现：IO 感知三件套","id":"改实现-io-感知三件套"},{"level":2,"text":"怎么用这张谱系做判断","id":"怎么用这张谱系做判断"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":3,"text":"延伸阅读 / 跨库链接","id":"延伸阅读-跨库链接"}],"prev":{"title":"二次复杂度瓶颈","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/efficient-attention-mechanisms/foundations/complexity-bottleneck"},"next":{"title":"稀疏注意力","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/efficient-attention-mechanisms/sparse-linear/sparse-attention"}}